<h1>Drama 3<span style="color:#85decd">.</span></h1>
<p class="d3-subtitle">Expressive speech. Compact expert weights.</p>
<div class="d3-lead"><p><strong>Expert-only Q2_K and Q3_K quantizations of <a href="https://huggingface.co/fishaudio/drama-3">Fish Audio Drama 3</a>, with custom ComfyUI nodes for packed expert RAM offload and CUDA inference.</strong></p>
<p>Drama 3 is a 35B mixture-of-experts text-to-speech model for voice cloning, multi-speaker dialogue, and expressive speech. These builds reduce its routed-expert storage while retaining the original precision of the remaining model components.</p>
<p><strong>Built with Fish Audio.</strong> This is an independent quantization and ComfyUI integration, based on <a href="https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-Drama3">PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-Drama3</a>.</p>
</div>
