<section class="d3-section" id="choose-a-quant"><span class="d3-section-no">01 / DOWNLOADS</span><h2>Choose a quant</h2><div class="d3-builds">
<div class="d3-build"><p class="d3-build-label">Smaller footprint</p><h3>Q2_K</h3><p class="d3-size">16.93 GB <small>model download</small></p><p>10.57 GB packed expert banks in system RAM.<br>2.625 bits per expert weight, including scales.</p><a class="d3-button" href="./drama3_q2_k_experts_bf16.safetensors">Download Q2_K ↗</a></div>
<div class="d3-build gold"><p class="d3-build-label">Higher expert precision</p><h3>Q3_K</h3><p class="d3-size">20.20 GB <small>model download</small></p><p>13.84 GB packed expert banks in system RAM.<br>3.4375 bits per expert weight, including scales.</p><a class="d3-button" href="./drama3_q3_k_experts_bf16.safetensors">Download Q3_K ↗</a></div>
</div><div class="d3-table-wrap"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Model</th>
<th align="right">Download size</th>
